[I] Knowledge of GHC's installation directories

[T] ghc-paths is a small Haskell library that records the location of the
[T] GHC installation it was built with, such as the libdir and the paths of
[T] the ghc and ghc-pkg programs, so that programs using the GHC API can
[T] find them at runtime.

[U] https://hackage.haskell.org/package/ghc-paths

[A] Simon Marlow <marlowsd@gmail.com>
